---
description: LoopKit loop engineering protocol for non-trivial engineering tasks
alwaysApply: false
---
For non-trivial tasks (features, bugs, refactors, builds, deploys, tests, design), follow `.loop/LOOP.md`.
Read the spine in `.loop/`, define a measurable goal with Verify commands, iterate
Goal -> Action -> Observe -> Adjust in small steps, persist state every iteration,
and finish with the Handoff Report.
